<refnamediv>
  <refname><function>SilikoFunctionDestroy</function></refname>
  <refpurpose>Function to clean up an in-language function</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Function.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">void SilikoFunctionDestroy(
	SilikoFunction *object);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <function>SilikoFunctionDestroy</function> function calls
  the <function>destroy</function> function in
  <varname>object</varname>’s <type>SilikoFunctionVTable</type>, then
  deallocates the memory used by <varname>object</varname>
  itself.</para>
</refsection>
